<title>USA: Financial Industries sets 5-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>Financial Industries sets 5-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Industries Corp said Monday that its board has approved a five-for-one split of the company's common stock and has authorized increasing common shares to 10,000,000.</p>
<p>The split requires shareholder approval, and a special holder meeting has been scheduled for November 12 in Austin.</p>
<p>The company said the effective date of the split will be determined later.</p>
